{"5051190":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Collapse Vector","steam_appid":5051190,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5191310,5192240],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLAPSE THE FIELD. REACH THE TRANSFER. SURVIVE THE VECTOR.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapse Vector is a fast-paced <strong>rage arcade<\/strong> space game about pushing deeper into unstable celestial fields.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge debris. Harvest collapsing matter. Open the transfer gate. Get out before everything falls apart.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or stay a little longer.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW FAR CAN YOU GET?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Transfer Gauntlet<\/strong> starts at Level 001 and keeps going.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every transfer drops you into a harder field. More debris. Faster hazards. Worse combinations. Less room for mistakes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enough matter to escape, then decide: transfer now, or risk staying for more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One bad decision can end the run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach Level 10. Then 20. Then 50.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe 100.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then keep going.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE THE VECTOR INCIDENT<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a 10-operation campaign across two acts, following the collapse from the inner system to Jupiter and Saturn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete multi-phase objectives, recover lost records, tackle optional challenges, and master each operation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign and Gauntlet progression are tracked separately, with their own records, statistics, difficulty settings, and suspended runs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE COLLAPSE<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every field is in motion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity shifts. Celestial bodies move. Ruptures tear through space. Shockwaves trigger chain reactions. Safe routes disappear.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the field, protect your probe, grab what you need, and reach the transfer.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR PROBE<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bank matter and earn talent points across three upgrade paths:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Harvest<\/strong> — Collection range, warnings, and matter yield<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armored Transfer<\/strong> — Shields, recovery, and defensive control<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overdrive<\/strong> — Speed, aggressive flight, and high-risk extraction<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching upgrades and mutually exclusive choices mean you can't take everything.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build around how you play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR FLIGHT<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hull finishes, engine effects, and ion trails by pushing deeper into the Gauntlet, completing campaign objectives, surviving celestial encounters, and chasing long-term milestones.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your probe in the <strong>Probe Bay<\/strong>, with unlocks shared across both modes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR CHAOS<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four difficulty profiles let you decide how hard the Vector pushes back, from a lower-pressure practice setting to the extreme <strong>Apex<\/strong> challenge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard difficulty and above are eligible for full mastery and cosmetic unlocks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, high-pressure <strong>rage arcade<\/strong> gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfer Gauntlet from <strong>Level 001 to Level 100 and beyond<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless high-level progression and personal record chasing<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-operation campaign across two acts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive top-down gravity flight<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic celestial fields and escalating hazard combinations<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets, stars, black holes, ruptures, debris, and shockwaves<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-versus-reward matter collection<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three branching talent trees<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four difficulty profiles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable hull, engine, and trail cosmetics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent records, statistics, run history, and suspended runs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial Codex<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and keyboard with remappable controller support<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive graphics, audio, interface, motion, flash, contrast, and warning-color settings<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in <strong>8 languages<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLAPSE THE FIELD. REACH THE TRANSFER. SURVIVE THE VECTOR.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapse Vector is a fast-paced <strong>rage arcade<\/strong> space game about pushing deeper into unstable celestial fields.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge debris. Harvest collapsing matter. Open the transfer gate. Get out before everything falls apart.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or stay a little longer.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW FAR CAN YOU GET?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Transfer Gauntlet<\/strong> starts at Level 001 and keeps going.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every transfer drops you into a harder field. More debris. Faster hazards. Worse combinations. Less room for mistakes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enough matter to escape, then decide: transfer now, or risk staying for more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One bad decision can end the run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach Level 10. Then 20. Then 50.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe 100.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then keep going.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE THE VECTOR INCIDENT<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a 10-operation campaign across two acts, following the collapse from the inner system to Jupiter and Saturn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete multi-phase objectives, recover lost records, tackle optional challenges, and master each operation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign and Gauntlet progression are tracked separately, with their own records, statistics, difficulty settings, and suspended runs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE COLLAPSE<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every field is in motion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity shifts. Celestial bodies move. Ruptures tear through space. Shockwaves trigger chain reactions. Safe routes disappear.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the field, protect your probe, grab what you need, and reach the transfer.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR PROBE<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bank matter and earn talent points across three upgrade paths:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Harvest<\/strong> — Collection range, warnings, and matter yield<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armored Transfer<\/strong> — Shields, recovery, and defensive control<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overdrive<\/strong> — Speed, aggressive flight, and high-risk extraction<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching upgrades and mutually exclusive choices mean you can't take everything.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build around how you play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR FLIGHT<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hull finishes, engine effects, and ion trails by pushing deeper into the Gauntlet, completing campaign objectives, surviving celestial encounters, and chasing long-term milestones.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your probe in the <strong>Probe Bay<\/strong>, with unlocks shared across both modes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR CHAOS<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four difficulty profiles let you decide how hard the Vector pushes back, from a lower-pressure practice setting to the extreme <strong>Apex<\/strong> challenge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard difficulty and above are eligible for full mastery and cosmetic unlocks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, high-pressure <strong>rage arcade<\/strong> gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfer Gauntlet from <strong>Level 001 to Level 100 and beyond<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless high-level progression and personal record chasing<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-operation campaign across two acts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive top-down gravity flight<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic celestial fields and escalating hazard combinations<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets, stars, black holes, ruptures, debris, and shockwaves<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-versus-reward matter collection<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three branching talent trees<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four difficulty profiles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable hull, engine, and trail cosmetics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent records, statistics, run history, and suspended runs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial Codex<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and keyboard with remappable controller support<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive graphics, audio, interface, motion, flash, contrast, and warning-color settings<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in <strong>8 languages<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Pilot an experimental probe through collapsing celestial fields in a fast-paced rage arcade space game. Push deeper into the Transfer Gauntlet, build your probe, chase records, and see how far you can get before the Vector ends your run.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5051190\/7302c366d4aebf033e65a787a1d470d2bf4e6219\/header.jpg?t=1793643286","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5051190\/0486471eb1c73849c2a3118b2a60923467e67eb9\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793643286","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5051190\/0486471eb1c73849c2a3118b2a60923467e67eb9\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793643286","website":"https:\/\/starfuelinteractive.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD FX-6300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620, NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030, or AMD Radeon RX 550<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound device<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 64-bit p